    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "2fdd407addec4499ffd2": "$n, how may I further your training in the eyes of the Earth Mother?",
        "4ad63843ce4c208ee429": "Many are the paths of the Earth Mother.  May your ancestors watch over you $c.",
        "62938a31331421a38980": "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew.  The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done.  It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining.  Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?",
        "90e9253eb97e204c3fc2": "I seek further druidic training to have a closer understanding of the Earth Mother's will."
      },
      "name": "Jannos Lighthoof",
      "subName": "Druid Trainer",
      "translationMetadata": {
        "fields": {
